    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so for the dead load, if i'm using 2x8 joists with the cedar decking, how much more weight does that actually add compared to a standard pressure treated setup? i'm trying to figure out if i need to beef up the beam size or if the post spacing can stay at 6ft.",
